    "highlights": "Heavy reliance on the custom brand font 'TwitterChirp' for all UI text, with inline responsive adjustments. Negative tracking is applied to large headings to improve visual coherence.",
    "insights": [
      "The system uses fluid 'calc' calculations tied to a root font size CSS variable, allowing the typography scale to intelligently adapt to user preferences and screen contexts.",
      "A strict hierarchical scaling is implemented, shifting seamlessly from very tight line-heights on display headings (0.9) to readable body paragraph line-heights (1.33).",
      "Consistently heavy use of medium (500) and semibold (600) weights to separate interactive and layout-critical components from regular prose, projecting structural clarity."
